.SS Changelog
.SS Unreleased
.SS 0.20.0 (2026\-05\-02)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Python 3.14 support
.IP \(bu 2
Removed support for Python 3.8 and 3.9
.IP \(bu 2
Upgraded Typeshed
.IP \(bu 2
Better support for Final/ClassVar
.IP \(bu 2
\fB__new__\fP is now also recognized as a signature and TypeVar inference
.IP \(bu 2
Support for \fBSelf\fP
.IP \(bu 2
Support for \fBTypeAlias\fP, generics for \fBtype[...]\fP and \fBtuple[...]\fP
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.19.2 (2024\-11\-10)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Python 3.13 support
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.19.1 (2023\-10\-02)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Python 3.12 support (Thanks Peter!)
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.19.0 (2023\-07\-29)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Python 3.11 support
.IP \(bu 2
Massive improvements in performance for \fBInterpreter\fP (e.g. IPython) users.
This especially affects \fBpandas\fP users with large datasets.
.IP \(bu 2
Add \fBjedi.settings.allow_unsafe_interpreter_executions\fP to make it easier
for IPython users to avoid unsafe executions.
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.18.2 (2022\-11\-21)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Added dataclass\-equivalent for attrs.define
.IP \(bu 2
Find fixtures from Pytest entrypoints; Examples of pytest plugins installed
like this are pytest\-django, pytest\-sugar and Faker.
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed Project.search, when a venv was involved, which is why for example
\fI:Pyimport django.db\fP did not work in some cases in jedi\-vim.
.IP \(bu 2
And many smaller bugfixes
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.18.1 (2021\-11\-17)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Implict namespaces are now a separate types in \fBName().type\fP
.IP \(bu 2
Python 3.10 support
.IP \(bu 2
Mostly bugfixes
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.18.0 (2020\-12\-25)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Dropped Python 2 and Python 3.5
.IP \(bu 2
Using \fBpathlib.Path()\fP as an output instead of \fBstr\fP in most places:
\- \fBProject.path\fP
\- \fBScript.path\fP
\- \fBDefinition.module_path\fP
\- \fBRefactoring.get_renames\fP
\- \fBRefactoring.get_changed_files\fP
.IP \(bu 2
Functions with \fB@property\fP now return \fBproperty\fP instead of \fBfunction\fP
in \fBName().type\fP
.IP \(bu 2
Started using annotations
.IP \(bu 2
Better support for the walrus operator
.IP \(bu 2
Project attributes are now read accessible
.IP \(bu 2
Removed all deprecations
.UNINDENT
.sp
This is likely going to be the last minor release before 1.0.
.SS 0.17.2 (2020\-07\-17)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Added an option to pass environment variables to \fBEnvironment\fP
.IP \(bu 2
\fBProject(...).path\fP exists now
.IP \(bu 2
Support for Python 3.9
.IP \(bu 2
A few bugfixes
.UNINDENT
.sp
This will be the last release that supports Python 2 and Python 3.5.
\fB0.18.0\fP will be Python 3.6+.
.SS 0.17.1 (2020\-06\-20)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Django \fBModel\fP meta class support
.IP \(bu 2
Django Manager support (completion on Managers/QuerySets)
.IP \(bu 2
Added Django Stubs to Jedi, thanks to all contributors of the
Django Stubs \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:typeddjango/\:django-stubs> project
.IP \(bu 2
Added \fBSyntaxError.get_message\fP
.IP \(bu 2
Python 3.9 support
.IP \(bu 2
Bugfixes (mostly towards Generics)
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.17.0 (2020\-04\-14)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Added \fBProject\fP support. This allows a user to specify which folders Jedi
should work with.
.IP \(bu 2
Added support for Refactoring. The following refactorings have been
implemented: \fBScript.rename\fP, \fBScript.inline\fP,
\fBScript.extract_variable\fP and \fBScript.extract_function\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
Added \fBScript.get_syntax_errors\fP to display syntax errors in the current
script.
.IP \(bu 2
Added code search capabilities both for individual files and projects. The
new functions are \fBProject.search\fP, \fBProject.complete_search\fP,
\fBScript.search\fP and \fBScript.complete_search\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
Added \fBScript.help\fP to make it easier to display a help window to people.
Now returns pydoc information as well for Python keywords/operators.  This
means that on the class keyword it will now return the docstring of Python\(aqs
builtin function \fBhelp(\(aqclass\(aq)\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
The API documentation is now way more readable and complete. Check it out
under \%<https://\:jedi\:.readthedocs\:.io>\&. A lot of it has been rewritten.
.IP \(bu 2
Removed Python 3.4 support
.IP \(bu 2
Many bugfixes
.UNINDENT
.sp
This is likely going to be the last minor version that supports Python 2 and
Python3.5. Bugfixes will be provided in 0.17.1+. The next minor/major version
will probably be Jedi 1.0.0.
.SS 0.16.0 (2020\-01\-26)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
\fBAdded\fP \fBScript.get_context\fP to get information where you currently are.
.IP \(bu 2
Completions/type inference of \fBPytest fixtures\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
Tensorflow, Numpy and Pandas completions should now be about \fB4\-10x faster\fP
after the first time they are used.
.IP \(bu 2
Dict key completions are working now. e.g. \fBd = {1000: 3}; d[10\fP will
expand to \fB1000\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
Completion for \(dqproxies\(dq works now. These are classes that have a
\fB__getattr__(self, name)\fP method that does a \fBreturn getattr(x, name)\fP\&.
after loading them initially.
.IP \(bu 2
Goto on a function/attribute in a class now goes to the definition in its
super class.
.IP \(bu 2
.INDENT 2.0
.TP
Big \fBScript API Changes\fP:
.INDENT 7.0
.IP \(bu 2
The line and column parameters of \fBjedi.Script\fP are now deprecated
.IP \(bu 2
\fBcompletions\fP deprecated, use \fBcomplete\fP instead
.IP \(bu 2
\fBgoto_assignments\fP deprecated, use \fBgoto\fP instead
.IP \(bu 2
\fBgoto_definitions\fP deprecated, use \fBinfer\fP instead
.IP \(bu 2
\fBcall_signatures\fP deprecated, use \fBget_signatures\fP instead
.IP \(bu 2
\fBusages\fP deprecated, use \fBget_references\fP instead
.IP \(bu 2
\fBjedi.names\fP deprecated, use \fBjedi.Script(...).get_names()\fP
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.IP \(bu 2
\fBBaseName.goto_assignments\fP renamed to \fBBaseName.goto\fP
.IP \(bu 2
Add follow_imports to \fBName.goto\fP\&. Now its signature matches
\fBScript.goto\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBPython 2 support deprecated\fP\&. For this release it is best effort. Python 2
has reached the end of its life and now it\(aqs just about a smooth transition.
Bugs for Python 2 will not be fixed anymore and a third of the tests are
already skipped.
.IP \(bu 2
Removed \fBsettings.no_completion_duplicates\fP\&. It wasn\(aqt tested and nobody
was probably using it anyway.
.IP \(bu 2
Removed \fBsettings.use_filesystem_cache\fP and
\fBsettings.additional_dynamic_modules\fP, they have no usage anymore. Pretty
much nobody was probably using them.
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.15.2 (2019\-12\-20)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Signatures are now detected a lot better
.IP \(bu 2
Add fuzzy completions with \fBScript(...).completions(fuzzy=True)\fP
.IP \(bu 2
Files bigger than one MB (about 20kLOC) get cropped to avoid getting
stuck completely.
.IP \(bu 2
Many small Bugfixes
.IP \(bu 2
A big refactoring around contexts/values
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.15.1 (2019\-08\-13)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Small bugfix and removal of a print statement
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.15.0 (2019\-08\-11)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Added file path completions, there\(aqs a \fBnew\fP \fBCompletion.type\fP now:
\fBpath\fP\&. Example: \fB\(aq/ho\fP \-> \fB\(aq/home/\fP
.IP \(bu 2
\fB*args\fP/\fB**kwargs\fP resolving. If possible Jedi replaces the parameters
with the actual alternatives.
.IP \(bu 2
Better support for enums/dataclasses
.IP \(bu 2
When using Interpreter, properties are now executed, since a lot of people
have complained about this. Discussion in #1299, #1347.
.UNINDENT
.sp
New APIs:
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
\fBName.get_signatures() \-> List[Signature]\fP\&. Signatures are similar to
\fBCallSignature\fP\&. \fBName.params\fP is therefore deprecated.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBSignature.to_string()\fP to format signatures.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBSignature.params \-> List[ParamName]\fP, ParamName has the
following additional attributes \fBinfer_default()\fP, \fBinfer_annotation()\fP,
\fBto_string()\fP, and \fBkind\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBName.execute() \-> List[Name]\fP, makes it possible to infer
return values of functions.
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.14.1 (2019\-07\-13)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
CallSignature.index should now be working a lot better
.IP \(bu 2
A couple of smaller bugfixes
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.14.0 (2019\-06\-20)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Added \fBgoto_*(prefer_stubs=True)\fP as well as \fBgoto_*(prefer_stubs=True)\fP
.IP \(bu 2
Stubs are used now for type inference
.IP \(bu 2
Typeshed is used for better type inference
.IP \(bu 2
Reworked Name.full_name, should have more correct return values
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.13.3 (2019\-02\-24)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed an issue with embedded Python, see \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:davidhalter/\:jedi-vim/\:issues/\:870>
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.13.2 (2018\-12\-15)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed a bug that led to Jedi spawning a lot of subprocesses.
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.13.1 (2018\-10\-02)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Bugfixes, because tensorflow completions were still slow.
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.13.0 (2018\-10\-02)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
A small release. Some bug fixes.
.IP \(bu 2
Remove Python 3.3 support. Python 3.3 support has been dropped by the Python
foundation.
.IP \(bu 2
Default environments are now using the same Python version as the Python
process. In 0.12.x, we used to load the latest Python version on the system.
.IP \(bu 2
Added \fBinclude_builtins\fP as a parameter to usages.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBgoto_assignments\fP has a new \fBfollow_builtin_imports\fP parameter that
changes the previous behavior slightly.
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.12.1 (2018\-06\-30)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
This release forces you to upgrade parso. If you don\(aqt, nothing will work
anymore. Otherwise changes should be limited to bug fixes. Unfortunately Jedi
still uses a few internals of parso that make it hard to keep compatibility
over multiple releases. Parso >=0.3.0 is going to be needed.
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.12.0 (2018\-04\-15)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Virtualenv/Environment support
.IP \(bu 2
F\-String Completion/Goto Support
.IP \(bu 2
Cannot crash with segfaults anymore
.IP \(bu 2
Cleaned up import logic
.IP \(bu 2
Understand async/await and autocomplete it (including async generators)
.IP \(bu 2
Better namespace completions
.IP \(bu 2
Passing tests for Windows (including CI for Windows)
.IP \(bu 2
Remove Python 2.6 support
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.11.1 (2017\-12\-14)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Parso update \- the caching layer was broken
.IP \(bu 2
Better usages \- a lot of internal code was ripped out and improved.
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.11.0 (2017\-09\-20)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Split Jedi\(aqs parser into a separate project called \fBparso\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
Avoiding side effects in REPL completion.
.IP \(bu 2
Numpy docstring support should be much better.
.IP \(bu 2
Moved the \fIsettings.*recursion*\fP away, they are no longer usable.
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.10.2 (2017\-04\-05)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Python Packaging sucks. Some files were not included in 0.10.1.
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.10.1 (2017\-04\-05)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed a few very annoying bugs.
.IP \(bu 2
Prepared the parser to be factored out of Jedi.
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.10.0 (2017\-02\-03)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Actual semantic completions for the complete Python syntax.
.IP \(bu 2
Basic type inference for \fByield from\fP PEP 380.
.IP \(bu 2
PEP 484 support (most of the important features of it). Thanks Claude! (@reinhrst)
.IP \(bu 2
Added \fBget_line_code\fP to \fBName\fP and \fBCompletion\fP objects.
.IP \(bu 2
Completely rewritten the type inference engine.
.IP \(bu 2
A new and better parser for (fast) parsing diffs of Python code.
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.9.0 (2015\-04\-10)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
The import logic has been rewritten to look more like Python\(aqs. There is now
an \fBInferState.modules\fP import cache, which resembles \fBsys.modules\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
Integrated the parser of 2to3. This will make refactoring possible. It will
also be possible to check for error messages (like compiling an AST would give)
in the future.
.IP \(bu 2
With the new parser, the type inference also completely changed. It\(aqs now
simpler and more readable.
.IP \(bu 2
Completely rewritten REPL completion.
.IP \(bu 2
Added \fBjedi.names\fP, a command to do static analysis. Thanks to that
sourcegraph guys for sponsoring this!
.IP \(bu 2
Alpha version of the linter.
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.8.1 (2014\-07\-23)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Bugfix release, the last release forgot to include files that improve
autocompletion for builtin libraries. Fixed.
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.8.0 (2014\-05\-05)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Memory Consumption for compiled modules (e.g. builtins, sys) has been reduced
drastically. Loading times are down as well (it takes basically as long as an
import).
.IP \(bu 2
REPL completion is starting to become usable.
.IP \(bu 2
Various small API changes. Generally this release focuses on stability and
refactoring of internal APIs.
.IP \(bu 2
Introducing operator precedence, which makes calculating correct Array
indices and \fB__getattr__\fP strings possible.
.UNINDENT
.SS 0.7.0 (2013\-08\-09)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Switched from LGPL to MIT license.
.IP \(bu 2
Added an Interpreter class to the API to make autocompletion in REPL
possible.
